      "relationship": "constrained_model_reading_predecessor",
      "note": "Reading detail may return the frozen M5 success envelope. M8 adds library metadata and does not supersede stored M5 reading artifacts. RE-PINNED 2026-08-27: contracts/m5 gained the amendment recorded in its own SCHEMA_MANIFEST.json amendments array, widening publisherProvider from const \"openai\" to the exact enum [\"openai\", \"codex\"] so Codex-generated daily readings can be described truthfully while historical OpenAI evidence stays readable. The digest above is the post-amendment value; every instance that validated under the const still validates, and no $id, required field, or schema_version moved."
    },
    {
      "package": "contracts/m6",
